      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<p>Antibody Used: Anti-SATB2 monoclonal antibody &nbsp;<br>Method: IHC on formalin-fixed paraffin-embedded (FFPE) tissue &nbsp;<br>Controls: Positive and negative controls included</p>\n<p>Results:</p>\n<p>Parameter &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | Description / Result &nbsp;<br>------------------------------------------------------------- &nbsp;<br>SATB2 Positive Cells &nbsp; &nbsp; | [Number / Percentage] of positive nuclei &nbsp;<br>Staining Pattern &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | [Nuclear] &nbsp;<br>Intensity of Staining &nbsp; &nbsp;| [Weak / Moderate / Strong] &nbsp;<br>Distribution &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | [Focal / Diffuse / Patchy] &nbsp;<br>Background / Comments &nbsp; &nbsp;| [Additional remarks, if any]</p>\n<p>Interpretation: &nbsp;<br>[Example:] &nbsp;<br>- Positive nuclear staining for SATB2 is consistent with colorectal origin or osteoblastic differentiation. &nbsp;<br>- Negative staining suggests lack of SATB2 expression in tumor cells. &nbsp;<br>- Correlation with clinical history, morphology, and additional markers is advised.</p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
